Do not create the Python install directory at configure time

file(MAKE_DIRECTORY) runs while configuring, so it tries to create the
install path in the root file system of the build host:
CMake Error at bindings/python/CMakeLists.txt:305 (file):
  file failed to create directory:
    /opt/ros/humble/lib/python3.14/site-packages/proxsuite/torch
The directory is created when the files are installed.

